abstract: >-
  Open-source zero-dependency Java 25 LTS / Java 27 research engine (HGS3 / HGS2 / EIMDL)
  with a wire-compatible native C23 / C++23 / Rust 2024 engine (eimdl), uniting Generation 1
  (HyperGraSS v1), Generation 2 (RC-MDL v2), Generation 3 (HGS2 .hgs2 v2.0, Laws I-VII),
  and Next-Gen EIMDL v3 (.hgs3 multi-omic FASTA/FASTQ+CDS & zero-FASTA compressed-domain
  genomics: analyze, direct VCF v4.2 calling, lazy k-mer search, and slice querying).
  Includes the complete LaTeX/PDF monograph, 14 publication figures and architectural
  blueprints, 1,859-check automated numerical audit, and Kaggle E2E cloud shootout verification.
